# Standalone app dependencies

Follow the Mandatory standalone app dependencies section in the root AGENTS.md.
- Provision private Python/Conda/FFmpeg and other required runtimes for each installed app.
- Support parallel copies and versions; use explicit app-owned executable paths and child environments.
- Keep writable caches, settings, services and runtime state scoped to the owning app.
- Do not change global PATH/environments or another app during install, update, repair or uninstall.
- Validate coexistence with another app when dependency provisioning or installers change.
- Keep the full policy in version-controlled AGENTS.md so it travels with local and GitHub projects.
